Use one version at a time.
To use a custom dataset, download and extract it into the datasets folder, \
then update the filenames below in the notebook (Import[\
\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]...\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote], \
\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]Table\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote]]). 

NuFIT v6.0 
http://www.nu-fit.org/?q=node/294#label85

NuFIT v6.1 
